(Bug #98: a letter after the `:` that is none of the specifiers in the
 table used to be dropped in silence and the hole rendered as a bare
 `{n}` - no padding request, no base request, no diagnostic. `q` is not
 a width, a precision, or a base letter, so it is refused by name.)

a number called n is 255.
Print "{n:q}".
